<view class="page youth-page">
  <view class="youth-kicker">青年报名 · 逐项确认</view>
  <view class="title">{{review ? '独立监护关系审核' : '青年报名与监护确认'}}</view>
  <view class="muted">必要资料处理、本人资格、监护关系和每种公开用途分别确认。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice warning" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice" role="status">{{message}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="notice warning">原请求结果待核对，已仅保留操作编号。重新读取回执前暂停新的提交。</view>
  <button wx:if="{{loginRequired}}" class="primary" bindtap="login">登录并继续</button>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card"><view class="skeleton-line"></view><view>正在读取当前状态与权限</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{policy}}" class="card youth-panel"><view class="subtitle">{{policy.eventName}}</view><view>{{policy.enabled ? '本届已启用青年确认' : '本届未启用青年入口'}}</view><view class="muted small">本届业务监护年龄阈值：{{policy.guardianAgeThreshold}}岁。年龄来源为独立核验的当前本人资料：参赛按赛事开始日，照片、档案和直播用途按当前处理日分别判断；页面声明不能替代核验。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{review && policy.canConfigure}}" class="card youth-panel"><view class="subtitle">开放报名前配置</view><view class="muted small">启用前须建立青年报名政策、必要材料流程与有权独立审核人员。未满14岁必要个人信息处理的监护确认不能由赛事配置关闭。本页不代表已满足所有地区法律要求。</view><checkbox-group data-field="policyEnabled" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{policyEnabled}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>明确启用本届青年确认流程</text></label></checkbox-group><text class="field-label">业务监护年龄阈值（18至21）</text><input class="field" type="number" value="{{threshold}}" data-field="threshold" bindinput="field" maxlength="2" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><button class="primary" bindtap="configure" disabled="{{busy || pending || loading}}">保存本届青年规则</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{!review && policy.enabled && policy.canInviteData}}">
    <view class="card youth-panel"><view class="youth-step">01 先取得必要资料处理同意</view><view class="subtitle">邀请独立监护账号</view><view class="muted small">只填写孩子别名和已有监护账号编号。此阶段不要上传身份证、照片、保单或家庭证明。监护人登录后明确确认，才继续收集必要资料；这不证明关系已核验。</view><text class="field-label">本人别名（1–40字）</text><input class="field" value="{{form.subjectAlias}}" data-field="subjectAlias" bindinput="field" maxlength="40" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text class="field-label">监护人的平台账号编号</text><input class="field" value="{{form.guardianUserId}}" data-field="guardianUserId" bindinput="field" maxlength="36" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><checkbox-group data-field="declaredYouth" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.declaredYouth}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>我选择青年报名入口，知悉实际年龄和监护关系还须核验</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="invite" disabled="{{busy || pending || loading || !form.declaredYouth}}">发送最小资料邀请</button></view>
    <view class="card youth-panel"><view class="youth-step">02 独立资格预审后本人确认</view><view class="subtitle">当前资料与参赛规则</view><view class="muted small">先由监护账号明确同意必要资料处理，再填写本人资料并主动申请资格预审。资格预审无需先购买保险；最终报名仍须核验保障和监护关系。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="materials" disabled="{{busy || pending || !hasMaterialScope}}">打开本人资料与资格预审</button><view class="youth-terms">确认版本 youth-participation-v1：本人同意以当前已核验资料和名单参加本届赛事，并知悉赛事规则、安全与保障要求。此确认仅用于本届参赛；下列公开用途分别自愿选择。照片宣传用于本届主办方和球队阵容海报；公开档案用于本届参赛与赛果公开展示；直播录像用于本届影像直播、整场录像和集锦处理。可撤回后续授权，已下载、转发或已消费的历史事实无法保证全部追回。不同意公开用途不单独影响参赛资格。</view><checkbox-group data-field="acceptedTerms" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.acceptedTerms}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>我本人已阅读并同意本届参赛确认</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="publicityConsent" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.publicityConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>允许本届照片宣传（可选）</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="archiveConsent" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.archiveConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>允许本届公开参赛与赛果档案（可选）</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="liveConsent" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.liveConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>允许本届直播、录像与集锦（可选）</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="propose" disabled="{{busy || pending || loading || !form.acceptedTerms || !hasMaterialScope}}">本人提出监护及用途确认</button></view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{preconsents.length}}" class="card youth-panel"><view class="subtitle">必要资料处理邀请</view><view wx:for="{{preconsents}}" wx:key="id" class="youth-row"><view>{{item.eventName}} · {{item.subjectAlias}}</view><view class="badge">{{item.statusLabel}}</view><view class="small muted">监护账号：{{item.guardianName}}</view><block wx:if="{{item.role === 'GUARDIAN' && item.status === 'INVITED'}}"><view class="youth-terms">youth-data-processing-v1：我作为受邀监护人，明确允许平台和本届有权组委会在本届必要范围内收集并私有处理该孩子身份、近期照片、资格和保障资料，供人工核验。该邀请仅使用别名和赛事，尚未向我开放孩子证件。可在此撤回，撤回将停止后续资料收集和新参赛动作；必要历史与争议记录按留存规则处理。本次不授权宣传、公开档案或直播，也不替代后续关系核验与参赛确认。</view><checkbox-group data-field="acceptedDataProcessing" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.acceptedDataProcessing}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>我明确同意上述本届必要资料处理</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-decision="CONSENT" bindtap="dataDecision" disabled="{{busy || pending || !form.acceptedDataProcessing}}">监护人独立同意必要资料处理</button><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-decision="DECLINE" bindtap="dataDecision" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">拒绝此邀请</button></block><button wx:if="{{item.status !== 'WITHDRAWN'}}" class="quiet" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-decision="WITHDRAW" bindtap="dataDecision" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">撤回此必要资料处理邀请／同意</button></view></view>
  <view class="card youth-panel"><view class="subtitle">{{review ? '当前关系审核队列' : '我的监护参赛确认'}}</view><view wx:if="{{!requests.length && !loading}}" class="muted">暂无记录。监护数据同意后还需本人资格预审与参赛提案。</view><view wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id" class="youth-row"><view>{{item.eventName}} · {{item.subjectName}}</view><view class="badge">{{item.statusLabel}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.current ? '当前来源版本可核对' : '来源已变化，请重新办理'}} · 监护人 {{item.guardianName}}</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">查看当前版本与可用操作</button></view><button wx:if="{{nextCursor}}" class="secondary" data-more="true" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">加载更多</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="card youth-panel"><view class="subtitle">{{selected.subjectName}} · {{selected.statusLabel}}</view><view class="small muted">V{{selected.version}} · {{selected.eventName}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected.reviewReason}}" class="notice">审核说明：{{selected.reviewReason}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected.blockerText}}" class="notice warning">当前阻塞：{{selected.blockerText}}</view><view class="small muted">本人用途：{{selected.subjectPurposeText}}<view>监护人用途：{{selected.guardianPurposeText}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{selected.capabilities.canReadProof}}" class="secondary" bindtap="reveal" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">明确查看监护人私密证明</button><view wx:if="{{privateDetails}}" class="youth-private"><view>监护姓名：{{privateDetails.realName}}</view><view>监护身份证：{{privateDetails.identityNumber}}</view><view>关系声明：{{privateDetails.relationship}} · {{privateDetails.relationshipExplanation}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="viewProof" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">私有查看关系证明文件</button><button class="quiet" bindtap="conceal">立即隐藏并清理预览</button></view>
    <block wx:if="{{selected.capabilities.canConfirm}}"><view class="youth-step">03 监护人本人独立确认</view><text class="field-label">监护人真实姓名</text><input class="field" value="{{form.realName}}" data-field="realName" bindinput="field" maxlength="80" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text class="field-label">监护人自己的身份证号</text><input class="field" value="{{form.identityNumber}}" data-field="identityNumber" bindinput="field" maxlength="18" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><radio-group bindchange="relationship"><label class="consent"><radio value="PARENT" checked="{{form.relationship === 'PARENT'}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/>父／母</label><label class="consent"><radio value="LEGAL_GUARDIAN" checked="{{form.relationship === 'LEGAL_GUARDIAN'}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/>其他有证明的监护人</label></radio-group><text class="field-label">监护关系说明（4–500字）</text><textarea class="field" value="{{form.relationshipExplanation}}" data-field="relationshipExplanation" bindinput="field" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><view class="muted small">仅上传必要的监护关系证明（JPEG/PNG/PDF，8MiB内）。证明私有加密保存，仅监护本人和有权独立审核人可读；请遮盖与核验无关的信息。自称关系和上传不等于审核通过。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="chooseProof" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">{{proofName || '选择监护关系证明'}}</button><view class="youth-terms">youth-participation-v1：我以自己的账号和真实身份确认本届参赛及当前监护关系，知悉赛事、安全与保障要求，并提交必要关系证明供独立核验。照片宣传、公开参赛与赛果档案、直播录像及集锦分别自愿选择，不由参赛同意自动授权。可撤回未来使用，必要历史记录及已消费赛果保留，已下载转发的影像无法保证追回。提交后仍须有权无关联审核人核验。</view><checkbox-group data-field="acceptedTerms" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.acceptedTerms}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>我作为监护人已阅读并同意本届参赛确认</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="publicityConsent" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.publicityConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>另行允许本届照片宣传（可选）</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="archiveConsent" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.archiveConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>另行允许本届公开参赛与赛果档案（可选）</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="liveConsent" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.liveConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>另行允许本届直播、录像与集锦（可选）</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="confirmGuardian" disabled="{{busy || pending || !form.acceptedTerms || !proofName}}">监护人独立确认并提交审核</button></block>
    <block wx:if="{{review && selected.capabilities.canReview}}"><view class="youth-step">04 独立关系核验</view><view class="small muted">不得由本人、监护人或关联球队成员/领队自审。请核对证明与监护人本人、当前成年状态和真实关系；格式有效不等于官方实名或关系已核验。</view><checkbox-group data-field="identityChecked" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{identityChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>已独立核对监护人身份、本人及当前成年状态</text></label></checkbox-group><checkbox-group data-field="relationshipChecked" bindchange="checkbox"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{relationshipChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><text>已核对必要关系证明，确认可作为当前监护关系依据</text></label></checkbox-group><textarea class="field" value="{{reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="field" maxlength="500" placeholder="填写4–500字核验说明，不抄录身份证或证明原文" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"/><button class="primary" data-decision="APPROVE" bindtap="review" disabled="{{busy || pending || !identityChecked || !relationshipChecked}}">通过当前关系证明</button><button class="secondary" data-decision="REJECT" bindtap="review" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">拒绝并说明</button></block>
    <button wx:if="{{selected.capabilities.canWithdraw}}" class="quiet" bindtap="withdraw" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">撤回本次监护参与与各用途确认</button>
  </view>
  <button class="quiet" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">{{pending ? '重新核对原请求回执' : '重新读取当前状态'}}</button>
</view>
<scb-nav active="Account" disabled="{{busy}}"/>
